<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Removes a single disease from a single character.
Disease effects are defined in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Diseases%202da" title="Diseases 2da (page does not exist)">diseases 2da</a> file.
</p>
